                'Nobody has fixed it because nobody has ever agreed that it is broken.',
                '“It is not fast,” Mr. Kowalski said, in the corridor, to nobody in particular, as he has said every year to a different nobody. “It is early. Early is a decision. Fast is a fault.”',
                'Brandon Lee had been in the band room since six forty, playing the same eight bars, and had stopped hearing the bell some time in his sophomore year.',
                '“Sir,” he said, “my metronome says I am two beats behind.”',
                '“Your metronome is a machine that has agreed to be confident.”',
                '“It is right, though.”',
