                'He did not have the heart to tell Tomas the truth on a postcard — that the woman was gone and no one knew where. So he told a smaller truth instead. I am the man who lives at number twelve now, he wrote. Miss Hart has moved on and left no address. But if you tell me about her, perhaps I can help you find her. He posted it to the port city and did not expect an answer.',
