                'Eren gets the speeches. Eren gets the close-ups, the trembling fists, the vow to level the whole rotten world. Good for Eren. There has never been a real Eren, not one, walking around your actual life. But Jean? Jean is everywhere. Jean just wants a stable posting, a warm meal, and to reach retirement with his organs on the inside.',
                'Earlier tonight I gave a whole confident speech about how a smooth life is the best life — no roller coasters, no drama, stay in the safe zone. Thirty minutes later I found myself moved, genuinely moved, by the most self-preserving side character in a world overrun by giants. The universe has a sense of humour, and it is aimed at me.',
